{"id":"vod_md_2990","vodId":"2990","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"干物妹！小埋","name_cn":"干物妹！小埋","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230822-1/b377122ef773e4dff6b49f7bd6350aaa.jpg"},"summary":"土间埋（田中爱美 配音），校园中女神一般的存在，成绩优异体育万能，个性温柔正直善良，然而，只有她的哥哥太平（野岛健儿 配音）知道，众人眼中光芒万丈的小埋，在进入家门的那一刹那，就会瞬间变成披着仓鼠斗篷，满地打滚，除了吃就是睡和玩的超级干物女。海老名菜菜（影山灯 配音）是小埋的好友，两人住在同一间公寓中，常常和太平以及小埋一同吃饭。本场切绘（白石晴香 配音）在无意之中捡到了小埋的学生证，于是一路找到了小埋家。橘（古川由里奈 配音）将在学校中视小埋为最强劲的对手，却在没有认出小埋的情况下和她成为了好友。最终，这些女孩子们是否会发现小埋的真实身份呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-22 07:38:54","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/rGOUT29h/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/115ujbT2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/ltO427qc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/iwduUznl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/ckXCk97q/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/cZEMq26a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/9cKQAI0V/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/0dphdRc0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/6KWzJjgj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/jG7aFWbJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/Dnd6zt0W/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/KK6kYJL4/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:08.225Z"}